  "questions": [
    {
      "q": "¿Qué encontró Natalia en la playa?",
      "a": "Un anillo de oro con dos nombres y una fecha dentro.",
      "q_en": "What did Natalia find on the beach?",
      "a_en": "A gold ring with two names and a date inside."
    },
    {
      "q": "¿Por qué Rocío no quiere el anillo en su casa?",
      "a": "Porque Luis ya no vive con ella y el viernes van a firmar los papeles para dejar de estar casados.",
      "q_en": "Why doesn't Rocío want the ring in her house?",
      "a_en": "Because Luis no longer lives with her and on Friday they are going to sign the papers to end their marriage."
    },
    {
      "q": "¿Cómo perdió Luis el anillo?",
      "a": "Se le salió del dedo mientras nadaba en el mar.",
      "q_en": "How did Luis lose the ring?",
      "a_en": "It slipped off his finger while he was swimming in the sea."
    },
    {
      "q": "¿Qué deciden hacer Luis y Rocío con los dos anillos?",
      "a": "Deciden guardarlos juntos para su hija.",
      "q_en": "What do Luis and Rocío decide to do with the two rings?",
      "a_en": "They decide to keep them together for their daughter."
    },
    {
      "q": "¿A quién llama Natalia el domingo, y qué le pide?",
      "a": "Llama a su madre y le pide que le cuente cómo era su padre.",
      "q_en": "Who does Natalia call on Sunday, and what does she ask?",
      "a_en": "She calls her mother and asks her to tell her what her father was like."
    }
  ],
